#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — a new Settings layout
 *
 *   - A sidebar of categories (Account, Appearance, Social & Calls, Notifications, Sound & Voice,
 *     Capture, Games & Library, Performance, Privacy, About) that stays in view, follows where you
 *     are, and takes you to a category when you click it.
 *   - Search: finds any setting by its name, description or related words, takes you to it and
 *     lights it up. Ctrl + F jumps to it.
 *   - Groups you can fold away (remembered on this PC). Sound devices is now a group, not a tab.
 *   - Every setting, its saved value and what it does is unchanged. Switches now work with the
 *     keyboard too. Works in smaller windows and with Reduce Animations.
 *
 *   Needs the emoji reactions and voice messages update first (aura-messages-emoji-voice-setup.cjs).
 *   No database changes.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-settings-layout-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-settings-layout-setup.cjs --undo
 */
